# shared defaults
flag dark-mode default off
when beta = yes then on
rollout 30

flag new-checkout default off
requires payments-v2
when country in SE,NO,DK then on
when plan = free then off
rollout 50

flag payments-v2 default on
when app < 2.0 then off

flag search_v3 default off
when app >= 3.1.4 then on
